/-!
# The trace formula

The Grothendieck–Lefschetz trace formula: the number of `𝔽_q`-points of a variety is the
alternating sum of the traces of Frobenius on compactly supported `ℓ`-adic cohomology,
in its sheaf-theoretic form, together with its transport along the coefficient stages.

Blueprint block `sec-trace-formula`.
-/
